i. Unica testimone dell'omicidio è Joanne Braslow, segretaria della vittima, un'ex cocainomane la cui devozione per il capo si tramuta ben presto in amore ossessivo.","language":"it-IT"},"tagline":{"value":"Un atto d'amore o un atto di omicidio?","language":"it-IT"},"releaseDate":"1993-01-15","status":"Released","rating":4.985,"ratingCount":359,"genres":["Dramma","Thriller","Romance"],"countries":["Germany","United States of America"],"facts":{"Runtime":"102m"},"keywords":[],"networks":[],"socialLinks":{},"cast":[{"id":3125,"name":"Madonna","role":"Rebeca Carlson","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/8XtGxpB4z428QDgwKlFYPktYHFC.jpg"},{"id":5293,"name":"Willem Dafoe","role":"Frank Dulaney","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/ui8e4sgZAwMPi3hzEO53jyBJF9B.jpg"},{"id":1231,"name":"Julianne Moore","role":"Sharon Dulaney","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/3YF19rWusxWfEI59ZM33dFhasRq.jpg"},{"id":10427,"name":"Anne Archer","role":"Joanne Braslow","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/y1uFANprVvJ9cCqVKSl0umIpIXw.jpg"},{"id":920,"name":"Jürgen Prochnow","role":"Dr. Alan Paley","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4489XcYBPCY0CoqLHN04Bjz4A3q.jpg"},{"id":8924,"name":"Frank Langella","role":"Jeffrey Roston","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/86DEo3sBguyc1l46606yVKD28T4.jpg"},{"id":22516,"name":"Lillian Lehman","role":"Judge Richter Burnham"},{"id":3266,"name":"Joe Mantegna","role":"Robert Garrett","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/4jzvAE6B1eoiZDUnDUuMazirCPP.jpg"},{"id":15414,"name":"Charles Hallahan","role":"Dr. McCurdy","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zQr2ytNB23Dy3uzbGkxfIsANw3y.jpg"},{"id":16936,"name":"Stan Shaw","role":"Charles Biggs","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/gq8VmKHlSZuBKBdwXFP48rIY4WR.jpg"},{"id":1007561,"name":"Michael Forest","role":"Andrew Marsh","profile":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/original/zG1BVNsy3htNKAtZvihWD3btEWN.jpg"},{"id":18262,"name":"Richard Rie